{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11204180","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11204180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419001:":{"text":"모래의 아이들이여, 두려움을 버리거라.","source_cn":"砂中的孩子，丢掉恐惧","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFEAD72DE9A58DCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419002:":{"text":"내가 너희에게 동요를 들려줄 테니,","source_cn":"我会为你唱响童年的歌谣","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05ABF8032D2D8AAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419003:":{"text":"바람결에 따라 방황하는 영혼이여","source_cn":"随风飘零的灵魂，若你感到彷徨","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE33F6DD91C2418EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419004:":{"text":"노랫소리를 따라 돌아오거라.","source_cn":"随着歌声回来吧","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x813BF56C57919A14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419009:":{"text":"잘 가게, 나의 친구…","source_cn":"再见了，我的朋友……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADF4CE41FE0B9314","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419005:":{"text":"눈물은 지친 영혼을 씻어줄지니,","source_cn":"泪水洗涤疲惫的灵魂","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC17362EE974C58F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419008:":{"text":"고맙습니다, 어머님.","source_cn":"谢谢，母亲","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3E6B1F29D390D2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419007:":{"text":"흑흑…","source_cn":"呜呜……<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5803DDBD679F7301","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120419006:":{"text":"돌아오는 길, 의지가 되길 바라노라.","source_cn":"愿你在归途中，有所依靠","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE3A053B6B4B55FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120418001:1":{"text":"여러분도 의식에 참여하러 오셨나요? 고인은 누구시죠?","source_cn":"你们也是来参加仪式的吗？逝者是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAED0F9B5681A3823","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120418002:0":{"text":"고인은… 잭슨이요.","source_cn":"逝者……你是说，贾克松？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3523DB5D53E6F3E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120418003:1":{"text":"잭슨…이었나요? 의식에 참여하여 영혼을 기리던 사람이 오늘은 영혼이 되어서 왔군요.","source_cn":"贾克松，是他吗……曾经参加仪式的人，今天却要成为安眠的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68E7C1FE287A4B19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120418004:0":{"text":"말씀 좀 물을게요. 여기서 무슨 의식을 거행하는 건가요? 저희가 트라이브는 아니지만, 잭슨의 유서를 가져왔는데…","source_cn":"不好意思，请问，在这里举办的仪式是什么？我们虽然不是蛮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1028B93D6D8B583E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120418005:1":{"text":"저희는 아주 전통적이고 오래된 <style=\"highlight\">눈물의 의식</style>을 준비하고 있어요. 혹시 들어보셨나요?","source_cn":"我们在筹备非常传统、非常古老的<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BF564D3132761DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1120418005":{"text":"저희는 아주 전통적이고 오래된 <style=\"highlight\">눈물의 의식</style>을 준비하고 있어요. 혹시 들어보셨나요?","source_cn":"我们在筹备非常传统、非常古老的<style=highlight>泣祷仪式</style>，如果你们听说过的话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BF564D3132761DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120418006:1":{"text":"마음의 슬픔을 눈물로 표출하는 의식이죠. 산자의 마음을 달래고 잠들지 못한 사자의 영혼을 위로하는 의식이랍니다.","source_cn":"泣祷——哭泣。放声大哭。以此来抚平生者的内心，慰藉逝者...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7288142101B2A39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120418007:1":{"text":"여러분에게는 평범할 수 있지만, 저희 트라이브들에게 눈물은 수치니까요.","source_cn":"这对于你们来说可能再普通不过，但是对于我们来说却很特殊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D4223FA1518F70A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120418008:1":{"text":"강함을 추구하는 트라이브가 눈물을 흘린다는 건 있을 수 없는 일이니까요. 소수 부족이 사적으로 눈물의 의식을 치르곤 하지만, 들키기라도 하면 모든 동족의 경멸을 받게 되죠.","source_cn":"因为蛮血以坚毅不屈为荣，流泪是弱化内心的陋习。虽然少数...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD82A080213B311EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120418009:1":{"text":"그러니 오늘 본 건 비밀로 해주시길 바랍니다.","source_cn":"所以，请你们对今天看到的一切保密。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4617189471955327","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120418010:0":{"text":"물론이죠. 의식에 대해 설명해줘서 고마워요.","source_cn":"谢谢你的介绍，我们一定会保护你们的秘密。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67D99CF47628A83F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120418011:0":{"text":"그럼 들어오세요. “어머님”은 여러분의 친구가 편안한 잠에 들 수 있게 준비를 마치셨답니다.","source_cn":"那么，请进吧，“母亲”已经准备好，愿你们的朋友得到安眠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47E29C91E4CFAEF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120418012:0":{"text":"어머님… 어머니?!","source_cn":"母亲？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE6525E43BCD5863","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120418013:0":{"text":"갈리, 저기 봐봐. 저 사람…","source_cn":"伽利，你看，那是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D5358972F3CF679","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1120418014:0":{"text":"엘리노어 선배야!","source_cn":"埃莉诺前辈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADF0796C991608CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"눈물의 의식이 뭐지?","source_cn":"泣祷仪式是什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3ED6360A0F4A2A37","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"눈물의 의식이 뭐지?","female":"눈물의 의식이 뭐지?","variant_male_record_index":"64192","variant_female_record_index":"64193","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"굉장히 슬픈 의식인 것 같군","source_cn":"听起来是一种很悲伤的仪式","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x52E3A689653DF1A5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_targe